infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title Herd reduction across the cache stack
  desc Each tier drops the herd by an order of magnitude — 10,000 misses → 1 rebuild
  sequences
    - label 10,000 concurrent misses
      desc TTL fires under a viral spike
    - label ~100 reach origin
      desc CDN: SWR + request coalescing absorbs 99%
    - label ~10 reach rebuild
      desc App cache: XFetch + single-flight collapse per-node herds
    - label 1 rebuild
      desc Redis lock collapses the cross-node herd for the hottest keys
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #14b8a6 #6366f1
